Package: IsoRemodel
Type: Package
Title: Paired and Unpaired Long-Read RNA Isoform Analysis
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Sherif", "Rashad", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "Sherif.mohamed.rashad.e3@tohoku.ac.jp")
Description: Imports Pigeon classification and junction tables, harmonizes
    splice-chain identities, performs RNA quality checks, depth-controlled
    isoform gain and loss, paired isoform remodeling with resampling and
    finite-count simulations, independent-group composition analysis with
    sample bootstrap and permutation tests, and differential transcript usage.
    Paired or unpaired designs and subject or sample exclusions use YAML
    configuration and an explicit sample metadata table. ORF prediction and
    protein-consequence analyses are outside the package scope.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
